        {
            "title": "今國光紅外線鏡頭熱賣挹注 前9月營收41.64億元超越去年全年",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"541\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/039b7071163e575d73b793773950d353831383639819bdaa4435a179472fc195/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2Fcb38d6a46c3c42fc503b3cd28fde10d5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></figure></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E4%BB%8A%E5%9C%8B%E5%85%89%E7%B4%85%E5%A4%96%E7%B7%9A%E9%8F%A1%E9%A0%AD%E7%86%B1%E8%B3%A3%E6%8C%B9%E6%B3%A8-%E5%89%8D9%E6%9C%88%E7%87%9F%E6%94%B641-64%E5%84%84%E5%85%83%E8%B6%85%E8%B6%8A%E5%8E%BB%E5%B9%B4%E5%85%A8%E5%B9%B4-120422270.html",
